WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:01.060
What's up guys!

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:01.900
We are Pongfinity.

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.460
We have just hit 400 000 subscribers

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:06.280
Thank you so much for all your support!

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:08.300
I think it's time to see Emil in action.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.180
One set match.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:10.080
Me against Emil.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:10.720
Let's go!

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:11.520
Good luck!

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:14.240
Alright, game on!

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.240
That was a pretty perfect return!

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.860
I was not expecting a short receive!

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.720
I went for the big backhand!

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:57.120
That was a good strawberry shot.

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:07.900
How did I miss that?

00:01:16.780 --> 00:01:17.480
You got me there!

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:45.720
My reaction time was like 2 seconds slower than the shot

00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:01.280
I had a chance there!

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:18.880
I set you up!

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:43.420
You can't get me with the edge!

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:45.060
I was expecting it!

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.380
Not even with the edge...

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.820
Lucky, lucky one!

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.240
Got you!

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:13.160
The winner!

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:15.260
That was a worthy winning shot!

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:16.700
Thanks!

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:17.780
Good match!

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.720
Alright, that was decent though.

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:22.640
It was!

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:26.380
Stay tuned for the big 500K match between me and Otto.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.760
The stakes are high!

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:28.780
Subscribe to our channel here

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:30.700
